{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill Space puts you in command of a lone explorer venturing into the vast and unforgiving cosmos. Armed with a powerful drill and an arsenal of devastating weapons, you must carve your path through hostile planets, extract valuable minerals, and defend your mothership against relentless alien invaders. Adapt to the ever-changing dangers of space, and survive as long as you can in the chaos of the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINE, CRAFT, SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill through planets, unearth valuable resources, and use them to craft weapons, gadgets, and powerful upgrades to enhance your ship. Every mineral brings you one step closer to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/d2d5188a4baa255b6ab0c29c5462bb21.poster.avif?t=1758798049\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/d2d5188a4baa255b6ab0c29c5462bb21.webm?t=1758798049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/d2d5188a4baa255b6ab0c29c5462bb21.mp4?t=1758798049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE YOUR WAY TO VICTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with powerful weapons to mine faster and defend against relentless alien threats. Collect, upgrade, and unleash powerful tools, each designed for specific challenges and customizable to help you tackle the ever-changing dangers of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/857ef299ed444fed44b23177a74d3c7e.poster.avif?t=1758798049\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/857ef299ed444fed44b23177a74d3c7e.webm?t=1758798049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/857ef299ed444fed44b23177a74d3c7e.mp4?t=1758798049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE COSMOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dynamic, randomly generated solar system, each with unique biomes, weather, mysteries, and dangers. Adapt to each world\u2019s challenges and reap its rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/ebb2f919d550278effbaa7f2559d9c02.poster.avif?t=1758798049\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/ebb2f919d550278effbaa7f2559d9c02.webm?t=1758798049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/ebb2f919d550278effbaa7f2559d9c02.mp4?t=1758798049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOLD THE LINE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mothership is your lifeline, and the alien threat is relentless. Arm yourself with powerful weapons to fend off escalating waves of invaders, fortify your defenses, and keep your mission alive. Stand your ground or risk losing everything to the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/4f2dc8a6c44a991e224888369aca2055.poster.avif?t=1758798049\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/4f2dc8a6c44a991e224888369aca2055.webm?t=1758798049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/4f2dc8a6c44a991e224888369aca2055.mp4?t=1758798049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530060?t=1758798049","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/8aaf58a834264ea25b8ea1f982d6dac47a78ff84/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758798049","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/cd0d3ab7da9b293e92f7c764be7a6ff505e86581/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758798049","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/cd0d3ab7da9b293e92f7c764be7a6ff505e86581/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758798049","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill Space puts you in command of a lone explorer venturing into the vast and unforgiving cosmos. Armed with a powerful drill and an arsenal of devastating weapons, you must carve your path through hostile planets, extract valuable minerals, and defend your mothership against relentless alien invaders. Adapt to the ever-changing dangers of space, and survive as long as you can in the chaos of the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINE, CRAFT, SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill through planets, unearth valuable resources, and use them to craft weapons, gadgets, and powerful upgrades to enhance your ship. Every mineral brings you one step closer to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530060/extras/d2d5188a4baa255b6